==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/slon/|lang=ru}}
* {{audio|Ru-слон.ogg|audio}}

===Etymology===
From {{proto|sla-pro|slonъ|lang=ru}}, possibly a deverbative from *{{term||sloniti sę|to lean against}}, relating to а medieval story of а sleeping elephant who leaned against a tree. According to some other sources, it's related to the Turkish {{term|aslan||lion|lang=tr}}.

===Noun===
'''слон''' (slon) {{m}}

# [[elephant]]
# {{chess|lang=ru}} [[bishop]] (Russian abbreviation: '''[[С#Russian|С]]''')

====Synonyms====
; chess piece
: [[офицер]] ''(informal)''

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-anim-2|слон||сло́н}}

====Derived terms====
* [[слонёнок]]
* [[слониха]]
* [[слоновий]]
* [[слоновый]]
; Diminutive forms
* [[слоник]]

====See also====
* [[морской слон]]

